  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>HCOOH</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>ml</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>ml</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>05</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>ml</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>HCOOH</mi></math>&nbsp;in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>525</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>HCOOH</mi></math> in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></math></p><p>Weight of water will be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>since</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>density</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>of</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>water</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>is</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi><mo>/</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mfenced><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>525</mn></mrow><mn>46</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mol</mi></math>&nbsp;[Assuming dilute solution]</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>&#916;T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></msub><mo>=</m